      "describe_ch": "能應用都市計畫制訂的邏輯與都市計畫法令規章於規劃實務",
      "describe_en": "Application of urban plan logic and urban planning laws/regulations to planning practice.\r\n"
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "describe_ch": "能應用生態永續、氣候變遷與都市防災的新技術",
      "describe_en": "Application of new techiques in ecological sustainability, climate changing, and urban disaster prevention."
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "describe_ch": "能應用溝通協調與團隊合作的成效解決問題",
      "describe_en": "Application of effects in communication, negotiation and team working to problem-solving."
    }
  ],
